{"r2-001-bootstrap-read": {"native_exit": 0, "stdout_start": "=== AGENTS.md ===\r\n# ResearchOS\n\n本仓库是独立 ResearchOS 产品，中文沟通。用户授权实现 `spec/v2.0/08_AGENT_EXECUTION_GOAL.md`，按难度选择子 Agent 模型。不得读取或继承其他业务项目的私有配置、身份、代码或部署。\n\n## 唯一执行基线\n\n- `spec/v2.0/`：原实施包逐字节只读快照；不得修改初始状态或验收阈值。\n- `execution/project_identity.json`：永久项目身份。`execution/bootstrap_ledger.json`：施工状态，独立于产品业务状态。\n- `execution/receipts/`：实际命令与产物回执；`execution/verifier/`：仅独立 Verifier 写入的施工审查。\n- `execution/checkpoint.json`：续跑入口。按 `spec/v2.0/contracts/tasks.json` DAG，先核对 Git、身份、输入版本及有效回执。\n- `bootstrap/`：开工导入与验证工具。W02 再由平台 owner 登记实际产品目录和命令。\n- `.local/`：本仓库生成的工具、进程数据与可重建缓存，不入 Git；不得放正式唯一证据。\n\n## 执行约束\n\n默认最多 2 个活跃施工任务；使用独立 worktree 和唯一 owner/lease。共享合同、锁文件、路由和命令登记串行整合。主 Agent 负责整合与真实验证；执行者不签发自身接受回执。只读审查可使用当前仓库，不能把同用户的不同 Agent 当作受保护留出隔离。\n\n模型策略：架构、安全、独立验收优先 `gpt-6-astra` 高推理；边界清晰的非平凡实现和施工复核用 `gpt-6-sol` 高推理；简单、低风险、可机械核验的独立工作用 `gpt-6-luna`。记录实际选择与理由，不创建用户侧新聊天，除非用户明确要求。\n\n保留既有修改；不用 reset/clean 或 git add .。允许本地原子提交，不自动 push、部署、购买、充值或对外发消息。规格校验、开发夹具、真实服务和产品正式验收分开记录；未实现和零断言不得 PASS。只对新变化和未解决疑点补验。临时文件完成后删除，证据/检查点保留。\n\r\n=== SCOPE SHA256 ===\r\nb43f950f884540f2daad10abc3872612bd15ccb40134de42a94ff1e415de1842\r\n=== SCOPE ===\r\n{\r\n  \"at\": \"2026-10-15T13:00:18.400536+00:00\",\r\n  \"model\": \"gpt-6-sol\",\r\n  \"reasoning_effort\": \"high\",\r\n  \"model_choice_reason\": \"Bounded independently reproduced exact-path repairs; independent astra review required after freeze\",\r\n  \"formal_increment\": 0,\r\n  \"actual_authority\": false,\r\n  \"self_acceptance\": false,\r\n  \"schema\": \"researchos.qualification-failure-B-revision02-source.v1\",\r\n  \"owner\": \"codex:/root/qualification_projection_builder\",\r\n  \"base_commit\": \"75e5257c19b2e21e6cabd5e912e2ac6a3e2fe603\",\r\n  \"base_tree\": \"ba3f9d4c101df39ab17856158d5fc72a9f0600ce\",\r\n  \"base_status\": \"NEEDS_CHANGES_NOT_ACCEPTED\",\r\n  \"worktree\": \"D:\\\\作品集\\\\ResearchOS\\\\research-os\\\\.local\\\\worktrees\\\\qualificatio", "stdout_end": "mutation.\",\r\n    \"Keep original raw3/ACK2/queue_empty=false/nativeexit facts; FAILED-onlyschema24 exact5versions/uploaded_content1 +enumeratedancillary/runtime_uploads&uses&proofs0, current authenticatedHostauthor/currentOwner-root, rollback/CAS/replay. Task/request/budget/moneyUNKNOWN/failcounts/schema/actualeffects unchanged. Preserve firstcause but extra laterfacts still disqualify. No unrelated broad historical tests once specific checks passed.\",\r\n    \"All commands recipewritten BEFORE execution; actualargv/cwd/relevantenv/rawstdout/rawstderr/nativeexit/fail/skips/gaps. NewownDtemps/cache/taskfixture, no olddeniedcleanup retries. Gofmt only5paths. Freeze cleancommit/tree, allsourcehashes, exact5deltafrom75 +WHOLEcombined9Bpatchfromf48 and combinedA+Bpathlist; explicitpatchflags/argv. Completeclaim-testmatrix/commandindex/diagnosticledger+FINAL. Preserve original29Brecords and reviewfailures, never reset. Independentastra needed beforeSource/Main/package/actual/formal.\"\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n\r\n", "stderr": ""}, "r2-047-effect-refs": {"native_exit": 2, "stdout_start": "internal/domain/durability.go:9:func latestEffect(tx *sql.Tx, project, run, key string) (Object, err", "stdout_end": "domain/runtime_model_windows.go-198-\t}\ninternal/domain/runtime_model_windows.go-199-\treturn reply, nil\ninternal/domain/runtime_model_windows.go-200-}\n", "stderr": "rg: internal/domain/runtime_effect_windows.go: 系统找不到指定的文件。 (os error 2)\n"}, "r2-063-bridge-ctor": {"native_exit": 0, "stdout_start": "23:const BridgeRevision = \"windows-appcontainer-v1\"\n55:type BridgeFrame struct {\n65:type BridgeReque", "stdout_end": "or {\n1086:func (w *Bridge) SealCheckpoint(ctx context.Context, seal CheckpointSeal) error {\n1092:func (w *Bridge) CheckpointBytes() ([]byte, error) {\n", "stderr": ""}, "r2-077-domain-refs": {"native_exit": 0, "stdout_start": "internal/domain\\backup.go:239:\tfor _, table := range []string{\"domain_objects\", \"domain_versions\", \"", "stdout_end": "nd,id,revision,f